    "BName": "Secondary Stat Training\nSkill Training\nSkill Training #2\nSkill Training #3\nSkill Training #4",
    "BDescription": "Secondary Stat Training\nCost: 200\nRequirements: -\nYou gain a +1 bonus to Fitness, Cunning, Reason, Awareness or Presence.\nThis breakthrough can be selected multiple times. The effects stack.\n\nSkill Training\nCost: 25\nRequirements: -\nYou gain a single skill point or two expertise points to spend on a skill. Crafting skills cannot be selected with this training.\nYou may select this breakthrough multiple times. Its effects can stack.\n\nSkill Training #2\nCost: 25\nRequirements: -\nYou gain a single skill point or two expertise points to spend on a skill. Crafting skills cannot be selected with this training.\nYou may select this breakthrough multiple times. Its effects can stack.\n\nSkill Training #3\nCost: 25\nRequirements: -\nYou gain a single skill point or two expertise points to spend on a skill. Crafting skills cannot be selected with this training.\nYou may select this breakthrough multiple times. Its effects can stack.\n\nSkill Training #4\nCost: 25\nRequirements: -\nYou gain a single skill point or two expertise points to spend on a skill. Crafting skills cannot be selected with this training.\nYou may select this breakthrough multiple times. Its effects can stack.",
    "Base Clim": "3000",
    "Start Mode": "Mirane Expedition",
    "Start Mode Clim Bonus": "1000",
    "Breakthrough Clim Bonus": "0",
    "Available Clim": "2650",
