      "appliedBuildId": "control-wizard",
      "summary": "Control Wizard applied for Human.\nCharacter start: Mirane Expedition.\nBuilt around reliable spell accuracy and utility. Focus and Reason support magic checks and control play.\nClass plan: Mage mastery (800 EXP), Elementalist key ability (200 EXP) = 1000 EXP.\nHuman can use every class and item in this package; no fallback is required.\nElementalist can follow Mage or Sorcerer. Mage is the stronger controller foundation because Decipher Magic, Arcane Barrier, Glittershards, Reason, and Magic Missile provide more control and utility than Sorcerer's damage-first progression.\nGear package: Armor (Clothing), Wand (One-Handed), Research Kit, Adventurer's Kit, Healing Potion.\nAuto-equipped loadout: Armor (Clothing), Wand (One-Handed), Research Kit, Adventurer's Kit. Consumables remain carried for use.",
